   $q$Which phrase would best begin sentence 8 to show how quickly the narrator acted?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-not-time"},{"text":"On the other hand,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-not-time"},{"text":"In conclusion,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ending-word-in-middle"},{"text":"Without wasting a second,","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Without wasting a second,$q$, $q$"Without wasting a second" shows that the narrator grabbed the baton right away. "On the other hand" signals a contrast, which does not fit picking up the dropped baton.$q$, 'draft', 'f2e2a17c-d73f-5bb1-a1c1-fd46509150ca')
