  ('93171ae8-754f-5695-aa9f-19f5ca7a7205', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g5-narrative-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Sentence 12 is the moment when the narrator learns the repair worked. Which change would best help the reader feel the importance of this moment?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Add a sentence after it about how rubber is made.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-fact"},{"text":"Expand it: \"We waited one minute, then two. I squeezed the tire, and it stayed firm.\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"Move sentence 12 to the very beginning of the story.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"breaks-sequence"},{"text":"Delete sentence 12 because the story is already long enough.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-event"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Expand it: "We waited one minute, then two. I squeezed the tire, and it stayed firm."$q$, $q$Waiting, counting minutes, and squeezing the tire slow the pacing so the reader shares the suspense before the success. Moving sentence 12 to the beginning would tell the outcome before the problem, which breaks the order of events.$q$, 'draft', 'f2771f24-c553-56c6-bd6d-90fdacbd670c')
