   $q$Which sentence best establishes the situation by telling who the characters are and what they are doing?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 1","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence 11","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"chooses-solution-not-situation"},{"text":"sentence 6","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"chooses-problem-not-situation"},{"text":"sentence 13","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"chooses-late-event"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 1$q$, $q$Sentence 1 introduces the narrator and Marisol and explains that they are coding a game for game design night. Sentence 6 is the problem in the middle of the story, not the starting situation.$q$, 'draft', '1586bfd3-b2c2-5c92-85b3-56005c13621c')
